[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2594337406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101603#issuecomment-2594337406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101603","id":2594337406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aonJ-","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T02:25:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T02:25:29Z","body":"Thanks for the PR! I'm not sure we want to add IDE specific configuration to the default `.csproj`. It adds clutter for all users and it seems this is only needed for Visual Studio.\r\n\r\nSince users still need to make additional changes to their Visual Studio configuration to nest the `.uid` files, I think it'd be better to document the `.csproj` changes along with the other steps required.\r\n\r\nI should also mention that C# support will be moving to a new GDExtension-based implementation, so I'm hesitant to add too much `.uid` handling, since `.uid` files won't be used by the new system.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2594337406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2594756460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101603#issuecomment-2594756460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101603","id":2594756460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aqNds","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T07:54:58Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T07:54:58Z","body":"Well actually that may not be VS specific. I don't have a Rider or other IDE but this should have the same effect on all editors who respect `.csproj`.\r\n\r\nMy primary concern is about the UX. This change allows users to see the annoying `.uid` file, prompting them to search online for how to hide it, eventually leading them to the file nesting documentation. Without this change, the `.uid` file won’t appear in the IDE, and users will treat it like a .import file, simply adding it to .gitignore. Later, when they complain about corrupted scenes, it will be harder for them to realize what they actually need is simply file nesting. The fewer steps users need to take, the lower the probability of them making mistakes.\r\n\r\n> I should also mention that C# support will be moving to a new GDExtension-based implementation, so I'm hesitant to add too much `.uid` handling, since `.uid` files won't be used by the new system.\r\n\r\nSpeaking of this, I’d like to ask about the current progress of this migration. It seems I’ve been hearing about it since 4.0.  If it is not going to land in 4.4 I think this patch make sense because the whole UID system is subject to more change in 4.5 dev cycle AFAIK. We can remove this if the UID system is clever enough when it reaches 4.5 beta :)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2594756460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692648693","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101603#issuecomment-2692648693","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101603","id":2692648693,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gfo71","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-02T09:45:52Z","updated_at":"2025-03-02T09:45:52Z","body":"I'm going to close this as 4.4 is about to release. This PR is meant to be a temporal mitigation for 4.4, for 4.5 we may need a more comprehensive solution.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692648693/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]